%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
% Absences and makeups
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

\newcommand{\SyllabusAbsences}{%
  \SyllabusItem{Absences \&\\Makeups}{%
    You are expected to attend all classes and take all quizzes and exams at the scheduled times.

    \begin{itemize}[itemsep=0pt,topsep=2pt]
      \item \textbf{Lectures:}
        Regular attendance and active participation are both expected and crucial for your success.
    
      \item \textbf{Homework:}
        There are no extensions or make-ups given for online homework.
    
      \item \textbf{Write-Ups and Quizzes:}
        There are no makeups for recitation write-ups or quizzes for any reason. Instead, the dropped write-ups and quizzes will account for absences due to minor illness and other unforeseen circumstances. You may also be excused from a quiz for religious observance.

      \item \textbf{Midterm Exams:}
        If you must miss a midterm exam, you must notify your professor as soon as possible. A makeup exam or other arrangement can be offered only if the absence is due to a religious observance or an unavoidable, verifiable emergency.
        
      \item \textbf{Final Exam:}
        The Final Exam cannot be excused, and you must take the Final Exam (or a make-up Final Exam). A student who does not take the final exam will fail the course, even if their average would otherwise be a passing grade.
    \end{itemize}
  }%
}

%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
% AI Policy
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

\newcommand{\SyllabusAIPolicy}{%
  \SyllabusItem{AI Policy}{%
    We genuinely want you to learn and succeed in this course. Our experience shows that students who rely on artificial intelligence to complete assignments do not learn as effectively as students who complete assignments on their own. For this reason, you should not use AI to complete the online homework, the recitation problems or the review sheet problems. There are no devices permitted during exams or quizzes, hence no use of AI is permitted in those cases.}%
}

